# playlists.txt — Playlist selection config for sync_to_android.sh
#
# Usage:
#   cp playlists.txt.example playlists.txt
#   # Edit playlists.txt with your selections
#   ./sync_to_android.sh --playlist-file playlists.txt
#
# Rules:
#   - One playlist name per line
#   - Lines starting with # are comments (ignored)
#   - Blank lines are ignored
#   - Wildcards supported: * matches any characters
#   - Matching is case-insensitive
#
# Examples:

# Exact names
My Favorites
Road Trip

# Wildcard: matches "Chill Vibes", "Chill House", "Chill Evening", etc.
Chill*

# Wildcard: matches any playlist containing "workout"
*Workout*

# Wildcard: matches "2023 Hits", "2024 Hits", etc.
20* Hits
